            "step 1.1",
            "algebra"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "step-2-2",
          "claim": "In the complex involutive case, $A_{\\rm sa}$ is closed under addition and real scalar multiplication by conjugate-linearity in [F4], and it contains the unit because $1^*=1$. For $a,b\\in A_{\\rm sa}$, $(a\\circ b)^*=\\tfrac12((ab)^*+(ba)^*)=\\tfrac12(ba+ab)=a\\circ b,$ so it is closed under $\\circ$.",
          "step": "2.2",
          "inputs": [
            "given",
