          "claim": "The other side expands, using [F2], as $(a\\circ b)\\circ a^2_{\\circ}=\\frac14(aba^2+ba^3+a^3b+a^2ba),$ which contains the same four terms as step 2.1.",
          "step": "3.1",
          "inputs": [
